          <text x="885" y="106" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3f5b78" data-page-node-id="ooTohs8yOdwqmlLNxYel2C">组织权限</text><text x="885" y="130" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3f5b78" data-page-node-id="GYsJsPSNjBa06XVIIbO3lY">角色授权</text><text x="885" y="154" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3f5b78" data-page-node-id="mNSJmHaWeoYsrWFp8sHwtt">系统日志</text><text x="885" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3f5b78" data-page-node-id="JjrrvOBZbZJuNcuI9MyolI">数据字典</text><text x="885" y="202" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3f5b78" data-page-node-id="NKhm9uHd9fW9qKqCG5ttHN">集成接口</text><text x="885" y="226" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3f5b78" data-page-node-id="Y6epgaM0KLEmF7M2nhcIB1">运维监控</text><text x="885" y="256" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" font-family="Rajdhani" fill="#0b7bc4" data-page-node-id="9fkQWS4NC9AMP6Bl7oBzuC">SYS</text>
        </g>
        <rect x="0" y="304" width="960" height="44" rx="6" fill="rgba(5,150,105,.10)" stroke="rgba(5,150,105,.3)" data-page-node-id="3CBFtMUZdhClz4j5gFe9bR"/>
        <text x="16" y="331" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#0f9d6f" data-page-node-id="JsuewPCK4Gx5rs77EAAtNA">公共支撑层</text>
        <text x="140" y="331" font-size="10.5" fill="#3f5b78" data-page-node-id="3kbutz70aHOwlCpmJqCUsG">组织架构 · 角色权限 · 消息通知 · 流程引擎 · 表单 / 建模 · 审计日志 · 集成接口 · 统一认证</text>
        <text x="944" y="331" text-anchor="end" font-size="9" font-family="Rajdhani" fill="#8199b0" data-page-node-id="zX3jJac2FE8bJvHjm7RjiB">PLATFORM</text>
        <line x1="480" y1="44" x2="480" y2="56" stroke="#0b7bc4" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#m-ar)" data-page-node-id="74B3yI21GCP5abkWluzdG9"/>
        <line x1="480" y1="294" x2="480" y2="304" stroke="#0b7bc4" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#m-ar)" data-page-node-id="k3vxNVCi2KviOn1h8Mlf43"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="grid g3" style="flex-shrink:0;" data-page-node-id="48MC4ZsKOBGZm4e99XtCer">
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="17a7YXrNMi3Du3EItgRPDj"><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="QgGYhU53UyZ5HrMlnVZVQM"><b data-page-node-id="QIOaTEZ9AsCAZZ9qVT7fcB">6 大能力域</b> · 覆盖审批、协同、人力、财务、文档、系统治理，构成 OA 的功能全集，产品差异主要体现在域内深度与横切引擎。</div></div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="SKSROaNpVWdJW3VSYsArDX"><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="b9u1K30tEUbpeTRvAx14aX"><b data-page-node-id="2C02Lo1bSEUGTmo4AN7goy">门户 + 支撑双带</b> · 上层统一门户收敛入口，下层公共支撑层沉淀组织权限 / 消息 / 日志等被复用能力。</div></div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="kt2912xHBZDy7sbNvXTSu3"><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="UbPfUcGLHDQHJmEBN2uoPn"><b data-page-node-id="aEej4azLuGiNYEX4GrCaWF">模块可插拔</b> · 各域通过统一权限码与菜单注册接入，新增域不改动核心，是平台化的关键设计。</div></div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="sm" data-page-node-id="Lb4WKJbTf3FIVj5BDK844S"><span class="smbar" data-page-node-id="wyUZbvru4ABod3uiCjyigS"></span><span class="smtext" data-page-node-id="B3J2uCq4RpzUMBMJ47FJx1">主流 OA 的功能骨架 = <b data-page-node-id="GAVXNj5MFhb6PBntvvAhaS">1 门户 + 6 能力域 + 1 公共支撑层</b>，共沉淀 <b data-page-node-id="2SgGyyvYWqT20Fa9gwMk0x">40+ 子能力</b>，是 zk-OA 的模块对标基线。</span>
      <span class="smspacer" data-page-node-id="FFMdnEVpEVj8Y2J7Ntpbks"></span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="2QjG5gphHPFfiG6FWK3S9d">1 Portal</span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="W5FCpz1zyHpz0flHDD6dUI">6 Domains</span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="HXrGCaIZEAspo6wiwvWgHx">40+ Cap</span></div>
    <div class="ft" data-page-node-id="NhINEYQjZF064H2PRL5mDj"><span data-page-node-id="8ueusHzHzTBc4pgspNjUSw">中科智电 · OA 系统架构与全流程</span><span class="prog" data-page-node-id="QgjroPorbEcDbworBxsiP3"><i style="width:27%" data-page-node-id="McQuOiK1pMlb6KklCkSVFz"></i></span><span data-page-node-id="9hAeYqi33FZCxfqAP1NACb">03/15</span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- P04 主流 OA 分层架构 -->
  <section class="slide" data-page-node-id="4gNS4LQaoWvIUnBvp2kF9d">
    <div class="hd" data-page-node-id="sxtIj1Nz3bIBCq2PpcBAKp"><div class="hl" data-page-node-id="DrthwdkuAjh5BsgieZMJnH"><div class="eyebrow" data-page-node-id="tPNGxpTvb7wllzEycWqTIH">PART 01 · 总体架构</div><h2 class="ptitle" data-page-node-id="edpEQeTN2Rt9DliOy9XzGH">主流 OA · 五层总体架构图</h2></div>
      <div class="hr" data-page-node-id="UY4iStYJWQVyEgmKIYJAC4"><span class="tag" data-page-node-id="92vXRp9l3VkQMun4FhAzfs">架构图</span><span class="lamp" data-page-node-id="RUcgTAJMA3bczeF3wOEEZE"></span><span class="pgnum" data-page-node-id="nrEknuQgA5jQC90YstyC5x">04 / 15</span></div></div>
    <div class="ct" data-page-node-id="BwNyC9inUeMGQIAGcfCvJb"><div class="wrap" data-page-node-id="Ky6aGPjI9crgQq6A0BAP5R">
      <div class="arch" style="flex:1;" data-page-node-id="I9IAUAY6Vw7TwvLOHOrJfy">
        <div class="layer l1" data-page-node-id="Aaf5HA3vBfTv792aCsv3zC"><div class="lab" data-page-node-id="vS8pIp6VHFjknxc1dL2ACU"><div class="len" data-page-node-id="wYmbb2JFoqrobK6jYKUQoX">PRESENTATION</div><div class="lcn" data-page-node-id="VNJJdyseY65EQshDQAKbTO">展现层</div></div>
          <div class="cells" data-page-node-id="0gB89CJ1msaHdLquo3mvyC"><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="6kknTyjwqYD9UHnHeXAS4u">PC 端门户</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="lODIu5XvzSCDgwH6LAlckr">移动端 App</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="TlADTniuwFOTwCnfD2Hh0G">统一工作台</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="nfMYN2s8RfjhVtM28puBLe">第三方系统嵌入</div></div></div>
        <div class="arrowdown" data-page-node-id="A6xAkdXE7WWbFKvIt6LQAK">▼</div>
        <div class="layer l2" data-page-node-id="DwW75qmhp7xvZ202CUMdfJ"><div class="lab" data-page-node-id="HO0kG3xAYc7o3e1rAoN0T1"><div class="len" data-page-node-id="a7Qmtq9PGYqWChHNGGPazG">APPLICATION</div><div class="lcn" data-page-node-id="hhxS78HJKoO6ZX8Z7nqQjC">应用层</div></div>
          <div class="cells" data-page-node-id="cwgXkeeQurwCprfWZR3PV2"><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="xS3dzcXxFYolDRDBKFLNVd">流程审批</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="FSxuB3tMWAd5kKPVwvor9h">协同办公</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="EwghfYS2zJzcOqGwu3CBUO">人力资源</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="ZaGxGHSqcab519xuklyUPU">财务费控</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="r6Dszuze2WyD7kzFJo7FCV">知识文档</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="7AwyccjWNqP3ukvHDfbQn8">系统管理</div></div></div>
        <div class="arrowdown" data-page-node-id="uA0zsd5oeCJGB1K3MKTDDp">▼</div>
        <div class="layer l3" data-page-node-id="2TEcxtjQafAUc7GwENctsF"><div class="lab" data-page-node-id="6B7KUn5XYAy1Ky08zdHVGG"><div class="len" data-page-node-id="a1HHLnbzkWVksAPk0WWvUs">ENGINE</div><div class="lcn" data-page-node-id="1zks05IS89FSSixWAn6b6q">引擎层</div></div>
          <div class="cells" data-page-node-id="1cmBDhUfMSSPq7LxaZQJ6s"><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="foNIyqreDFQNpFwJMcua0G">流程引擎</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="2AhksookkAnu5L9ryENcSi">表单引擎</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="rIMoBS9UO9N1KCgUPiD4Hd">建模引擎</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="DCepz0K5CZQRP3Sz2SyBYU">内容引擎</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="65ZtG6Jok768Ndbd2X8BtX">消息引擎</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="0YAPrYSc1OHGr7iz34hPeN">权限引擎</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="W9aBQrxgHgYHkWGZi33Yi9">报表引擎</div></div></div>
        <div class="arrowdown" data-page-node-id="2EBRAVktriamJx6OiUmHju">▼</div>
        <div class="layer l4" data-page-node-id="ieUXbdHZEfvi6SU7Vs4LTV"><div class="lab" data-page-node-id="VZl82oQ7JR8yoLaOcpG6Sb"><div class="len" data-page-node-id="WgDLiRDAY6D0sW2ymg8bXy">DATA</div><div class="lcn" data-page-node-id="Kb9TyXvQW4nLXb9A2iHb0G">数据层</div></div>
          <div class="cells" data-page-node-id="CZV7VcO2FArf4sFBo3bPj1"><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="qx3EbGpBPFo6wtwtcqLUWR">关系数据库</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="mZzXNXf3KOuyodgjBp459K">文档库</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="rALIkhAXO3LMztbmFaWzHh">缓存</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="iGsTZErkQHe65C5v3VMPNd">对象存储</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="82z8KWuWCJ9jyV95oUgCsL">全文检索</div></div></div>
        <div class="arrowdown" data-page-node-id="EPDcpr0v9yZaBouYuW966i">▼</div>
        <div class="layer l5" data-page-node-id="Vz3GURriVR4Bg7PD8pzXWL"><div class="lab" data-page-node-id="D2fM93SdgNLRN98eKIUTMJ"><div class="len" data-page-node-id="zYQAMYx3jrz2qRNXrRL3LO">INFRA</div><div class="lcn" data-page-node-id="vquqLNASdNsVvmh1pXVgDr">基础设施</div></div>
          <div class="cells" data-page-node-id="ldXFYzpsbGXcF8yDsoq2yA"><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="zCinEOqJLAiJdxFOe618yg">容器编排</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="0uxOxm8ALWChOvA1niu5Ez">API 网关</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="7eWdLoLDS0GmdSZAW65NMe">监控告警</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="GLOgebPff9dEknNCz6ZJ1N">安全审计</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="RUIrux9ZZ6XwKBpvjgbYYj">备份容灾</div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid g3" style="flex-shrink:0;" data-page-node-id="Iw6oAtBcuYqZ7rVssrc8Bf">
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="sXUGSWFJTcDYruXdc1zXYR"><div class="ch" style="font-size:11px;" data-page-node-id="KiIdZ6N7qIXULq7GIeCEni">请求流向</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="DuFLHk7dVF9TCFcoIJURVo">自展现层向下逐层依赖，引擎层被应用层复用；数据层与基础设施横向被所有层调用，形成「纵向分层 + 横向共享」的稳定结构。</div></div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="mpchosHF2g6428G7DGTeeq"><div class="ch" style="font-size:11px;" data-page-node-id="dDpMidyy7G6WIlolnErub4">引擎层是核心</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="LZ6SYyKbITbLqh0YKapdDn">7 大引擎把「流程、表单、建模、内容、消息、权限、报表」抽象为独立能力，应用层只做业务编排——<b data-page-node-id="JDfxVRdRIk8vKZWwND7CPs">换业务不换引擎</b>。</div></div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="6O2sapCuTdF4UhasjWF0hS"><div class="ch" style="font-size:11px;" data-page-node-id="TNG51nARTxBKtdjozSXXyj">对标要点</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="lsjCMlD6BfHH4Sl9emg2Y8">zk-OA 采用同构五层，但以 FastAPI 分层（Router→Service→Repository）替代传统 Java 中间件，<b data-page-node-id="dqZCUHLmxUCcdtTevhazEH">引擎为纯函数实现</b>，更易单测。</div></div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="sm" data-page-node-id="COVKG2WoQNMWtImqCWEKTG"><span class="smbar" data-page-node-id="0V1dLXHGqZKbJty32KFZeq"></span><span class="smtext" data-page-node-id="poCanJhFrpfAVhb7Y5WWny">总体架构 = <b data-page-node-id="9W8wWXVagT0FKAy2VFNVeQ">展现 / 应用 / 引擎 / 数据 / 基础设施</b> 五层；引擎层集中 <b data-page-node-id="e38xna1sw3KF9y7H5IoYUP">7 大引擎</b>，是 OA 产品差异化的主战场。</span>
      <span class="smspacer" data-page-node-id="Hif4wQGcPZsu4e3nptJRGT"></span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="SIHGDF5C3jr67lOiXwWX2I">5 Layers</span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="aeAk6atMeKfGiF9lH0C1mJ">7 Engines</span></div>
    <div class="ft" data-page-node-id="rIrRurAoTddXdf29rHVQmh"><span data-page-node-id="HFcBktKVvGql0gqx1aMmUu">中科智电 · OA 系统架构与全流程</span><span class="prog" data-page-node-id="GyCIhJQXMZ5H3TH7PKD4S6"><i style="width:33%" data-page-node-id="NmruIVxd9jj2Fq02BbjBfe"></i></span><span data-page-node-id="Gyo5kGLSlj84jqXPAozhQG">04/15</span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- P05 主流 OA 引擎矩阵 -->
  <section class="slide" data-page-node-id="B1GK56cQza7TYidV8Jircj">
    <div class="hd" data-page-node-id="ihZv4P3jd8WN1V2O8vbBf4"><div class="hl" data-page-node-id="3QpOVwdgUgAQLaRyZNwRLl"><div class="eyebrow" data-page-node-id="GHSwNqsAnNtbGex7GeJix8">PART 01 · 技术底座</div><h2 class="ptitle" data-page-node-id="4uIxaxzt7EQqh3KfGRu2M9">主流 OA · 七大引擎能力矩阵</h2></div>
      <div class="hr" data-page-node-id="h4RKYqyxkW5JM0ZBCnLoJi"><span class="tag" data-page-node-id="CYlXwWydqU8lGhb4PKW4oD">引擎矩阵</span><span class="lamp" data-page-node-id="bEX2MvfR9fD9H2wdgwUnuM"></span><span class="pgnum" data-page-node-id="hs6MlZVcnZJBM9YcFoFVr1">05 / 15</span></div></div>
    <div class="ct" data-page-node-id="KfxefFK9a4kxyCKTKbnqgU"><div class="wrap" data-page-node-id="xTwgYGO3tuSFYSlOAA5qmw">
      <div class="grid g4" style="flex:1;" data-page-node-id="Mn0PVPowT4ihVvbcSgUPG5">
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="A0KbZDhTIqq0GTSQnj3DU1"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="uuB29g3C4IdVgiocJ30EiS"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="BZXvHZxLDuF2CW98AgTLZe">WF</span>流程引擎</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="To4nDPeayZRtkQ2wCGVgZB">驱动审批流转的核心：图遍历、条件分支、会签 / 加签、超时升级。决定流程能否「任意画、正确跑」。</div><div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="yCLfy0gwyRl2uK4DcQDCpZ"><span data-page-node-id="I2rVEFiVAVM2tvqpRWi1cu">会签</span><span data-page-node-id="2nZJ4ebuBBRQa78yBups6n">加签</span><span data-page-node-id="XqWXbGhh8RvFoDLB2YWofp">条件分支</span></div></div>
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="viyuqVu6CZqNMnJd6j8blm"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="Yome00ydGVTFYq1jw6ywtB"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="yH6zvR7hiKJCUhyDTqzqE6">FM</span>表单引擎</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="jDMMy0SYr7A0KdrAjA796c">可视化拖拽生成业务表单，字段类型 / 校验规则 / 布局配置化，与流程节点绑定形成「表单 + 流程」组合。</div><div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="vhqHTr7h86X3ZynA9gnDsy"><span data-page-node-id="eB99VA2edWFklcthHoHsmr">字段类型</span><span data-page-node-id="rsilPM7qRQJ2ifMFIJkuhR">校验规则</span><span data-page-node-id="F3dmBjK0oq48ZFZGnFlxl4">布局</span></div></div>
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="kP2Z7YKESHCxDMCGA4eECS"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="1LIiHZj3FQjPAYrtaeAv9q"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="8rmKstkQ6Oz7G7z57T6dBm">MD</span>建模引擎</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="cC42zSGnb4GJNXkTffPh61">零代码建业务台账：定义实体与字段，发布即录入。主流方案多走动态建表或元数据 + JSON 列两条路线。</div><div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="HTbQL4qEWfOHYHRtR2S8sL"><span data-page-node-id="FN3A47r4n5qeV1Kg2JSHXQ">实体定义</span><span data-page-node-id="COHDc07QXIYzLVa4U1qXiW">动态数据</span><span data-page-node-id="K4ivUCo8fj1Vvi3IaGmZMF">零 DDL</span></div></div>
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="0DVKnzkcL75EG8x0DjoIvQ"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="Abk40tUFKxMkCRGaam6MhS"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="ABthLC8O5urzxzvwIVlxIj">CT</span>内容引擎</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="mJw43a6ASuSNqMrrOoCypj">文档集中管理与受控分发：元数据、版本、鉴权下载、分类检索，是知识沉淀与合规留痕的载体。</div><div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="idoi7XboWW0lt5jez1tvQH"><span data-page-node-id="WdqSiJOLUvJSEVbJDgMMTt">版本</span><span data-page-node-id="go1Pj87vT9bCznmV66J0G6">鉴权下载</span><span data-page-node-id="TH9L8IzuKd4hanWJPVHo1C">检索</span></div></div>
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="R2uWv7yZGeFgRHBNMT1ttX"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="5XsobE5cHeQmfDQU4f6HAj"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="wUtLxXO2tFP3NTkDnCdgmX">MS</span>消息引擎</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="J8GL5K0RrrG7HJEH1KstKj">统一待办与通知触达：站内信、邮件、短信、IM 多通道，支持实时推送与已读回执，保障流程不「卡壳」。</div><div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="NQGq7LQ515rMT95ICRkeZo"><span data-page-node-id="HHPDEL7WSuq81oAEEaxejS">多通道</span><span data-page-node-id="fsQMqYL12WDoclrYB38blt">实时推送</span><span data-page-node-id="34GHRCcGYxldzlMaqBrmYW">回执</span></div></div>
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="PWBwrtE7d2dZFA93zCsSwA"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="8tjkPM4j0BVLVmpG7gA60W"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="taSo4oRhtjRSUHELbo5SwA">RB</span>权限引擎</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="88kotHpDMFTuZOHbrLWESO">以 RBAC 为核：用户—角色—权限码三层映射，支持菜单 / 按钮 / 数据行多级管控与组织维度授权。</div><div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="WOQi2LfqhDPqfLS8WX0d9o"><span data-page-node-id="FS5KbtJH3nYoXWQ1XOzPs6">RBAC</span><span data-page-node-id="Jtj3D2Wx6Z3T5Lx3VqHqWu">权限码</span><span data-page-node-id="AW48IkUH7mr1EQTgROExH3">数据行</span></div></div>
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="9Xw1yxaWNtQfEfY4CgiP7M"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="ZPI1f1VFYeKHYspdLL5PMD"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="DxoGxDjbtlp5gbpbx559JY">RP</span>报表引擎</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="cJ3GmgH367pJQ7Pe9OSCCQ">把流程与业务数据转成管理视图：流程效率、费用分布、考勤统计，支持仪表盘与导出下钻。</div><div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="Wyx6BLMngIfDzJrwjxv61C"><span data-page-node-id="Am3M4EivNyZWvrZI8hxYLq">看板</span><span data-page-node-id="px0b9tVfoNaSduHMRt5vYd">统计</span><span data-page-node-id="oBm1PMjHetDhKNK7eJ16Yd">导出</span></div></div>
        <div class="card accent" data-page-node-id="y1udsiQUSA8eDhFBPOIWHK"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="ciZu4KGtCa16SYEOhEhJdu"><span class="ic" style="background:rgba(4,18,31,.2);border-color:transparent;color:#04121f;" data-page-node-id="JVVktyh0JzJ83YjmX6ntcK">＋</span>集成引擎</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="QbRpmKS7xhnHUAtADgMWMv">横向扩展位：对接 ERP / CRM / 财务 / 钉钉企微，以 API 与事件总线打通异构系统，是 OA 从「孤岛」到「中枢」的关键。</div><div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="UZsUlViCSMneYPMPDIAY0K"><span data-page-node-id="MSEPzBJ6MDB6OYFzWjr24G">API</span><span data-page-node-id="jP5ba6WSL0WJuJPtIj47yP">事件总线</span><span data-page-node-id="ktp4xbFktFXyiGKUojLObN">单点登录</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="sm" data-page-node-id="wqm285AN9F6s1onA1mXrlO"><span class="smbar" data-page-node-id="iBnkZRn4cDtF0i4aGPhw4K"></span><span class="smtext" data-page-node-id="v62tyAWh78fbO3gJtG5mGS">七大引擎 + 集成引擎 = OA 的 <b data-page-node-id="4zF6CRePMdS9Y1D5fSWVME">技术底座</b>；引擎成熟度直接决定 <b data-page-node-id="BwFCUu0GYtx6nMLGhGE5X3">业务可配置化程度</b> 与二次开发成本。</span>
      <span class="smspacer" data-page-node-id="Ry0mld1lsowjnI6Sjd7kpr"></span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="mVCtEu9w58d9SOOuASeFRx">8 Engines</span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="mFGiFNH5Ci3coSGmQ3DXBg">Low-Code</span></div>
    <div class="ft" data-page-node-id="TPdxKui8kofSKgumcD39zk"><span data-page-node-id="HzsyqWosHjdntqnQwZGwvS">中科智电 · OA 系统架构与全流程</span><span class="prog" data-page-node-id="cviBulJlgV9TqlWldEvRND"><i style="width:40%" data-page-node-id="y1a5L2Eo5l1o8qJHEyYpCh"></i></span><span data-page-node-id="9IkNCsA8nP7aPmjJNFlgPD">05/15</span></div>
  </section>

