        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 9px;" data-page-node-id="7CT9Be9oR7Mus27TVFpjon"><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="zfsBiPnQETB1mN5vhxdkJV"><b data-page-node-id="GR3OyAv2HRWJ7VvIZu9HMA">② 审批</b> · 主管 / 部门逐级审批，支持会签、加签、转办；条件分支自动路由到对应职能。</div></div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 9px;" data-page-node-id="2KBfYCujffsbU7vT8JkAZx"><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="xUaambTxKtXbrGQ5LEzCwb"><b data-page-node-id="4Ze3zXhQ8QWFbChHDZ2Gv2">③ 归档</b> · 通过的流程自动归档至内容引擎，形成可检索、可审计的业务留痕。</div></div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 9px;" data-page-node-id="hywXu4sCGAMsYTaDFgwfDY"><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="3sw9MsGw4NzhpC8h0f0iBi"><b data-page-node-id="touThdvvpCkEmH1Y1mvOcW">④ 回写</b> · 终态回写业务单据状态，消息引擎实时通知发起人，形成闭环。</div></div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="sm" data-page-node-id="hbt2OMKiblQkzvXrgFWa6E"><span class="smbar" data-page-node-id="4ONd1mNdSmgA4dGJe6W7GU"></span><span class="smtext" data-page-node-id="LlzgHD17GLGpyLJRnLx75s">端到端流程 = <b data-page-node-id="vQoEipDTnMQtNo5vUGTSA4">5 泳道 × 6 步</b>：发起 → 审批（含条件分支）→ 归档 → <b data-page-node-id="maD2Sq53I1M04HMOQJxTEY">结果回写 + 实时通知</b>，闭环是成熟度的分水岭。</span>
