      <div class="divname" data-page-node-id="X7cf7udUnEt0M6MUucwuQP">zk-OA 系统现状</div>
      <div class="divdesc" data-page-node-id="bhNfywmycJ6PaCIXGUsn5W">中科智电自研 OA —— 以 <b data-page-node-id="mEU6jNzlXHAuF6KzhiakoI">FastAPI + React 19</b> 全栈实现，对齐泛微 e-cology 七大引擎路线图。<b data-page-node-id="0DdXGkHUX3sqp7BsBgBVqS">6 大功能模块</b>已上线，<b data-page-node-id="9v6oyKKamApyTebpW4bEDR">七大引擎</b>按 P0→P4 分批落地，后端 <b data-page-node-id="r1UAV3h7OpjrXEYARvKI7r">59 项测试</b>与 <b data-page-node-id="RWM7YEdz6U2j8OfUNRuvDB">128 项 HTTP 冒烟</b>全绿。</div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="ft" style="z-index:2;" data-page-node-id="5MuUAW6P6LsVxEbGDkLFZA"><span data-page-node-id="XhdLS1oDGEMz9rLUqehIsO">PART 02 · zk-OA 系统现状</span><span class="prog" data-page-node-id="mWJlQTzVUV4DZ8Wr3UU8sT"><i style="width:53%" data-page-node-id="AhuqFfuRPWCZKMFq7lFP6O"></i></span><span data-page-node-id="RTX9xNRWFr2Uh1cU6E9NX6">07/15</span></div>
  </section>

