          <div class="cells" data-page-node-id="S9SGsOUiN1vDPNDnYPeYoe"><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="GuFlzseBUGG9uRv4a4rNz9">PostgreSQL 16 / SQLite</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="YmPcGp8hSulcUnuI8sIIBh">SQLAlchemy(async)</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="JVmEBp2CBwbIR2URjIIqJN">Alembic 迁移</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="KBZSSxBDFG75lNigB2I0er">本地 uploads / S3</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="BlBPQC7FRzjlzyNBcxgA1m">Docker Compose</div><div class="cell" data-page-node-id="MmeCVHlMaVXb17yPK6H6b4">GitHub Actions CI</div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid g3" style="flex-shrink:0;" data-page-node-id="T21NitqQGA33OEBwT1uJTJ">
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="Q0Tfg6RQnFQZzwlZjbE16Z"><div class="ch" style="font-size:11px;" data-page-node-id="grHYwGxWpHn2Ai8VgLV7TK">分层解耦</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="ZKau9w3qp91QhypG6xjEcB">Router 只做参数与依赖、Service 管事务与业务、Repository 用 <em data-page-node-id="52GjflA07d5EW9PEDaoXGt">selectinload</em> 防 N+1；引擎为<b data-page-node-id="QhxjT7BLVTR7oUNKmQvmkF">零依赖纯函数</b>，可脱离框架单测。</div></div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="3Dl59G5n1GOJ2JcewVLW2A"><div class="ch" style="font-size:11px;" data-page-node-id="6BPCGH3xxMQxWk6tuDkyTF">双存储适配</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="rlTILE6ADMd5c9o4fNxELr">开发用 SQLite 零配置，生产切 PostgreSQL 16；模型变更由 Alembic 迁移，<b data-page-node-id="TuHnyws7gC6fHKeRX6ktDm">SQLite/PG 双环境</b>已验证通过。</div></div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="JFnAVt3C0My1pSb0Pn1c3R"><div class="ch" style="font-size:11px;" data-page-node-id="myZf1zeiqOfXfgUMDgcd4a">安全基线</div><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="4HwoSWAG92dqweGc16Hs40">访问令牌 15 min + 刷新令牌服务端可吊销；密码用 <em data-page-node-id="pCmspAWXHOwjHQrjAbgpcW">PBKDF2-HMAC</em> 哈希（零原生依赖）；审计中间件零侵入留痕。</div></div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="sm" data-page-node-id="bqtlAJLL1UNx1dHjTz3kvt"><span class="smbar" data-page-node-id="ySI0FCyCUsPMNISyGuaimv"></span><span class="smtext" data-page-node-id="4f4BC08NgbhyV1qaDxYv2d">zk-OA 采用 <b data-page-node-id="fhyQuJOVfVCUsVIGioOApq">五层同构架构</b>：前端 → 接入 → 服务 → 引擎 → 数据/设施，以纯函数引擎 + 双存储适配实现<b data-page-node-id="zeyIhBHWJ7mhkyE8WshQaz">轻量但对标</b>。</span>
      <span class="smspacer" data-page-node-id="l2qyVOy7TuxHO8wa5YajWt"></span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="vqGQPKnk8zOE2nBpmKMjEa">5 Layers</span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="seiQ8iboN7BXSAou668wLy">纯函数引擎</span><span class="chip" data-page-node-id="9VjCltjuA7NB2GMKOnBgNc">双存储</span></div>
    <div class="ft" data-page-node-id="Bv8wIuMe9yWAFFifNeHbiX"><span data-page-node-id="K0PzCwinytp0ag1uiFP2zC">中科智电 · OA 系统架构与全流程</span><span class="prog" data-page-node-id="lyxapfLEwwGBvmtoFKGAHh"><i style="width:67%" data-page-node-id="cF5hyr5DFByoFUwQb2d58S"></i></span><span data-page-node-id="3UolfsDeSFLZFCWAAeB22O">09/15</span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- P10 技术栈结构图 -->
  <section class="slide" data-page-node-id="dgql9RDeE2RydPMlABBj8E">
    <div class="hd" data-page-node-id="GHWLGq2RiiZ3wvnRJwtiBl"><div class="hl" data-page-node-id="v7oCxNHnHHtGfS5ttLdxME"><div class="eyebrow" data-page-node-id="ZkLvEazoEzLMV8IdHh1efo">PART 02 · 技术选型</div><h2 class="ptitle" data-page-node-id="M1pPG8U2We7F5Biu9RDFAE">zk-OA · 技术栈结构全景图</h2></div>
      <div class="hr" data-page-node-id="3Uy9HWZzb3cqGT8rGx1Bpj"><span class="tag" data-page-node-id="nBndwzmFgYrATsmIVsHUCe">技术栈</span><span class="lamp" data-page-node-id="JoDfggycCQCDr5a3AObVzG"></span><span class="pgnum" data-page-node-id="D1bkcSw3HlIqojxrGZugjE">10 / 15</span></div></div>
    <div class="ct" data-page-node-id="RjqryhCmGrWVRyqLHSDCtP"><div class="wrap" data-page-node-id="tCQA7DaNwh8NK0o32VPP4y">
      <div class="grid g4" style="flex:1.15;" data-page-node-id="JZPbQKEYDKtNNuYuJvUoUB">
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="lkPSwrxn79LmZlUMSufw3N"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="EvGi1K3QYa5HSCgAiZ7yYa"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="hnoBS3mdcFblkRsSUKIqXm">UI</span>前端</div>
          <div class="cb" data-page-node-id="v9gRCakshj5Fdjr7sSKjOm">React <b data-page-node-id="cKaK2RndBBFiayhaXts9zj">19</b> + TypeScript 严格模式；AntD 5 组件库；Vite 6 构建，TanStack Query 管缓存，axios 类型化客户端。</div>
          <div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="pMk6DV8owtOqcUVDFpTYtE"><span data-page-node-id="qoW9vIuWBmZvdIxezUnzHF">React 19</span><span data-page-node-id="fZbVJOO7947IPIKxRB6CuU">TypeScript</span><span data-page-node-id="uyCRDLgctw2rtXycS0R66b">AntD 5</span><span data-page-node-id="SNtb2qkecc4RlBG1dWVQ4q">Vite 6</span><span data-page-node-id="75c5sByC9SvM2vTJTtK06Q">TanStack Query</span><span data-page-node-id="y2m23jkR9JULZzhSUMWWm9">axios</span></div></div>
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="Dkq1nK5CWVVwTxBTLQOsae"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="c4E4Dm5MJBEagFvIe7SO3q"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="28En9psIruJ3rEZ3J3m2tb">API</span>后端</div>
          <div class="cb" data-page-node-id="V53PFWaHjTi1508W0o00JQ">FastAPI 提供 OpenAPI 文档与依赖注入；Pydantic v2 做请求校验；SQLAlchemy 2 异步 ORM，Alembic 管迁移。</div>
          <div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="sXTGFpckg6Jm49Ja87nL2W"><span data-page-node-id="opOUwSRJyKu2le21Lu8EpK">FastAPI</span><span data-page-node-id="74InObs6pnh5yN8ououDPY">Python 3.12</span><span data-page-node-id="VDB4R6aJtTA3bhvOVZP3Fk">Pydantic v2</span><span data-page-node-id="V66V1b6gA8f1ksoSWoMEVP">SQLAlchemy 2</span><span data-page-node-id="CGPg2HJbQAqDygGE4lsuVy">Alembic</span><span data-page-node-id="iXKiCqSGiyP42AKgGg0NMo">Uvicorn</span></div></div>
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="0jP1G280VyuC0dPGoQEoHw"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="3LrdNxbM1BJLjZaBmUZ64j"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="sWn66pEukhSwnsnJWlpOqe">DB</span>数据与存储</div>
          <div class="cb" data-page-node-id="i8oUwjobzfRtePkhgKgsVy">生产 <b data-page-node-id="msZZ2QnVAPHF60SYGdV4Jr">PostgreSQL 16</b>，开发 SQLite 零配置；审计日志走物理列索引，建模数据存 JSON 列并限流 <b data-page-node-id="L5EhAPChSpcmmYEMRzaq26">2000</b> 行扫描。</div>
          <div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="WKosNfCiEoUYwebyHlRlHC"><span data-page-node-id="cYhENRCq1WtebdbotxVvRI">PostgreSQL 16</span><span data-page-node-id="fDHgFKU495bCDEmrk4V1Jr">SQLite</span><span data-page-node-id="RykO8ohnx1kbFs8dt2FIj2">asyncpg</span><span data-page-node-id="8mDDNf5I80KGtmTIDgSeFs">本地 uploads/</span><span data-page-node-id="AH9WPbvYVvUfwBMJ0zkDuq">对象存储 S3</span></div></div>
        <div class="card" data-page-node-id="GH858x1bYvsmGvJz4urm7P"><div class="ch" data-page-node-id="XVaY3GaaWeEizOEfwl6bQM"><span class="ic" data-page-node-id="xHe57UMJSgcFH7iU3DA4lp">OPS</span>部署与工程</div>
          <div class="cb" data-page-node-id="6xiOBRbYXhFlJblk32uIS1">Docker Compose 编排三服务（db / backend / frontend），Nginx 托管静态资源并透传 SSE；CI 跑后端编译测试 + 前端类型检查。</div>
          <div class="chiprow" data-page-node-id="rMMPlUtlE8IaINrHjkPjCy"><span data-page-node-id="r0jn7d7jPSZyYiBdmXKjtJ">Docker Compose</span><span data-page-node-id="uUUQt5iBesiMPH2vBkIL6A">Nginx</span><span data-page-node-id="hF7r8LCVK4UaXTBVNwFwUR">GitHub Actions</span><span data-page-node-id="Y1LIp4Hbf4laFGYbPAkFEj">/health · /ready</span></div></div>
      </div>
