        <text x="16" y="112" font-size="10" fill="#3f5b78" data-page-node-id="eDgVlQ4TSuwDp4VENDTK6r">→ JWT 双令牌：访问令牌 <tspan fill="#0b7bc4" data-page-node-id="f7UVqusgpbGmRvwmRiwH8q">15min</tspan>，刷新令牌服务端存储、可吊销、登录轮换</text>
        <text x="16" y="134" font-size="10" fill="#3f5b78" data-page-node-id="0jmyG6a4fzuVJ9Da9ECSK5">→ 密码哈希 <tspan fill="#0b7bc4" font-family="Rajdhani" data-page-node-id="HH2Mh97P85A9FFEmI4w0Jl">PBKDF2-HMAC</tspan>（零原生依赖、跨平台可移植）　·　审计中间件零侵入记录所有变更请求</text>
      </svg>
      <div class="grid g2" style="flex-shrink:0;" data-page-node-id="4LR9nMZ3AOd56umDZpqvIq">
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="E7E6FCRCF3ZohTlFAYaKlz"><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="FJbUtOd8xRvQDvQLRzj2Q4"><b data-page-node-id="8D0FwULsyAHziZuS8eeUu9">选型原则</b> · 前端重体验（AntD 组件即战力）、后端重可测（纯函数引擎 + 分层）、存储重可移植（SQLite/PG 双兼容），整体 <b data-page-node-id="RZraNjVeSFsLtgp1UaSCn0">零原生依赖</b> 优先。</div></div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:6px 10px;" data-page-node-id="drSvhtOZdbnXbqKpC0d4qG"><div class="cb" data-page-node-id="99H71L1tGyS6KHUXWbKw9z"><b data-page-node-id="vJqEYGBRVuEZ8Opq2PqM7j">工程门禁</b> · CI 并行跑后端 <em data-page-node-id="z5lJ2kWMqOfqfAf7MiBRmx">compileall + pytest</em>（SQLite 免外部库）与前端 <em data-page-node-id="bBWoWHwIhPfmUyHX7WpNcK">typecheck + build</em>，把质量左移。</div></div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="sm" data-page-node-id="h54wAxmDjBORTthRAADLLR"><span class="smbar" data-page-node-id="pBnXTz7zGTn3Gesmn5OzmD"></span><span class="smtext" data-page-node-id="HDHeC2yxJosrhM24Ro3lGX">技术栈 = <b data-page-node-id="aG5NVrKImSAwAVN53xOqKy">React 19 + FastAPI + PostgreSQL</b> 三位一体；工程链路含 JWT 双令牌、PBKDF2 哈希、Docker/Nginx 与 CI 门禁。</span>
