  <!-- P11 引擎能力对标表 -->
  <section class="slide" data-page-node-id="p5Jpt5LypJhcFdzynjj67z">
    <div class="hd" data-page-node-id="AY1oUqDCjxeJnpsdf5Kfvt"><div class="hl" data-page-node-id="yTar2v6LKTJ6SilZqVvXWp"><div class="eyebrow" data-page-node-id="GnI000MvRDJCWtCwcdmqa6">PART 02 · 能力对标</div><h2 class="ptitle" data-page-node-id="QC6Z1s7i2eK1fsAWnLA4u8">zk-OA · 七大引擎对标落地表</h2></div>
      <div class="hr" data-page-node-id="iEZSnAGns58uGIHIN08uqs"><span class="tag" data-page-node-id="zptwwpa5h3MnrCGXWFsBM3">对标表</span><span class="lamp" data-page-node-id="8lNnJiYLHkwAxbGmNYkluU"></span><span class="pgnum" data-page-node-id="IjdQl74rDLdt030DO1MbPm">11 / 15</span></div></div>
    <div class="ct" data-page-node-id="LSSwBZY5sIjgEKDqE6NSeF"><div class="wrap" data-page-node-id="UBOgiWdl8BOG4B9f9kBIEx">
      <div class="card" style="flex:1;padding:10px 12px;" data-page-node-id="nnWk6ok2PaVO7FDSiyoz9M">
        <table class="tbl" data-page-node-id="wAaZBVKst41xF4Qxi1fXWe">
          <thead data-page-node-id="ATp8WGFiPVIA2vlb5cWAjC"><tr data-page-node-id="XQ4xHXEPp4rF26gATIVzPZ"><th style="width:13%;" data-page-node-id="ssikCImGHLkbII1eMLZJto">引擎 / 能力</th><th style="width:29%;" data-page-node-id="YVqha1LGTjV8BhynoeGiju">主流 OA 能力定义</th><th style="width:44%;" data-page-node-id="wiolPHAlSAZSg4GqVAHtlR">zk-OA 落地实现</th><th style="width:14%;" data-page-node-id="awDcfiHR7oDOoaMmb0RgYD">状态</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody data-page-node-id="a2RVuH735YQ1mGAnWyZTfO">
            <tr data-page-node-id="EEQQCf4IQDYWH4ba5CJCZz"><td data-page-node-id="mHQ5gNYUqrFST1UQaRMqeH"><b data-page-node-id="MMYt1WrHxvZhhthM3o0P7L">流程引擎</b></td><td data-page-node-id="S0Uz2Qo2ki91jcUG3qYDv5">流程建模、节点审批、会签 / 加签、超时升级</td><td data-page-node-id="VaUinA8jjpJ07uHIjQBy5s"><em data-page-node-id="h17BYAFclE8YQl820r3MJ0">workflow_engine.py</em> 纯函数图遍历；会签 / 加签 / 转办 / 撤回 / 催办；审批委托改派；监控看板 <em data-page-node-id="rk0CDexmMc3QLbeChvGxNP">/api/workflows/stats</em></td><td data-page-node-id="DmbOMjs9G3ApMHys4CKwjt"><span class="st ok" data-page-node-id="IF3YAAwdkgTxHQ8p9TUC8K">✅ 已落地</span></td></tr>
            <tr data-page-node-id="9EteltB4pCHFH1AOdOQu0T"><td data-page-node-id="KSDggIEWhJawgN7g0YHpQk"><b data-page-node-id="d489FS13eHvE5ybfSt2jA1">建模引擎</b></td><td data-page-node-id="QpD4VCYkRDEFwL86SaCVwG">零代码自定义实体、表单与数据</td><td data-page-node-id="17SEMa8nhCp5VWfEPBhfsN">实体定义 + JSON 数据列，<b data-page-node-id="sQSubqpGK5PqYG2SuuRvTQ">零 DDL</b>；11 种字段类型；draft/published 生命周期；<em data-page-node-id="5mcN5o18QWA45UqY9RxGd4">MAX_SCAN=2000</em> 限流</td><td data-page-node-id="9FByUZ0QhTDWHLWwT0WDWN"><span class="st ok" data-page-node-id="X80gAcWp5pgyTIN7VRvGCk">✅ 已落地</span></td></tr>
            <tr data-page-node-id="ZtSPj5fRaGQlj8wnWp5swW"><td data-page-node-id="Zi9OUJv3JSGGDOQzqaFWtC"><b data-page-node-id="cn9oDg4ZzNV2fHS5vLjb4p">内容引擎</b></td><td data-page-node-id="RyUmHkTrBY0dBnw4ixQ5K0">文档集中管理、版本、鉴权分发</td><td data-page-node-id="xzY0z2wnIOW9Xl0Z8oYdDU">文档中心 + 文档版本；<em data-page-node-id="zgN0AC6O5LmOAr5wtjPTU8">{id}.{ext}</em> 落盘防穿越；扩展名白名单；鉴权下载；本地 uploads 可换 S3</td><td data-page-node-id="PytmgARZdBvKU4O2UQYoZs"><span class="st ok" data-page-node-id="5nM7pqeQWiiP3E1Wbgh4jR">✅ 已落地</span></td></tr>
            <tr data-page-node-id="fI3ieg5bZyhg24lv3VmZBN"><td data-page-node-id="AH0xAOayEAbbIKCNCcdumB"><b data-page-node-id="pMgkQjBaDG9paLhMnkjoAg">日志中心</b></td><td data-page-node-id="vL2CHLSHEbbM0tB5h8Fqd3">全量操作审计、可检索追溯</td><td data-page-node-id="yPXELXT8u8atxW77MhXYRI"><em data-page-node-id="5XRlLlWiOyc3ZRPF6QHlST">AuditMiddleware</em> 零侵入；actor/module/action/status 物理列索引；近 14 天趋势；<em data-page-node-id="0NQ3qtvtODKavAMgP89EXs">/api/audit/*</em></td><td data-page-node-id="1clpLucDUrYmoFXeCPHffW"><span class="st ok" data-page-node-id="ZDUhszjnFb52lFROEKFTHU">✅ 已落地</span></td></tr>
            <tr data-page-node-id="ngA3J3F3TYKkNyF1UUi3YK"><td data-page-node-id="zGHuKADKJfLW3Z3sja1zJx"><b data-page-node-id="HJmsQsNWp7px043KT8G2ng">组织权限</b></td><td data-page-node-id="n2jHL66PvldxDJo1idbJNr">用户 / 角色 / 权限码三层管控</td><td data-page-node-id="4D0Nm1uL3iv3ekGcZHUX9C">RBAC + 权限码；角色 CRUD 需 <em data-page-node-id="zKkZBF5zq9TeeAywGK3QtO">org:role:manage</em>；<b data-page-node-id="wEB9ii54YjZczD7lc8Se6R">RBAC 边界 16/16 通过</b>（员工 403 / 管理员 200）</td><td data-page-node-id="9ZJPJpJhgFaTAIRIbdwsOj"><span class="st ok" data-page-node-id="ldY5rtzJzWqBHPxwz0teMW">✅ 已落地</span></td></tr>
